h the Hawks playing at 8:30 p.m.\n\nFor both games, that\u2019s a 7.5 hour gap from the start of one to the start of the other.\n\nIf the Valkyries win the game, they win the series, but will they be able to celebrate on the court? Will Cathy Engelbert be there to present the trophy to the team and award the MVP? Will USA Network be able to have its postgame live in the arena?", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1609, "width": 1080}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreibdvnm7quo6tqhqyygptuogabpaqdyc5uynzdyewvjynmzzfo44sm"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 378973}}]}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.record", "record": {"cid": "bafyreidrdyta2qk6qyjaikndgyno6473nquwprowhfgwxqadghajrohcwq", "uri": "at://did:plc:2talt3msahtgmd52hjx2weld/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxxra7tgj2z"}}}, "langs": ["en"], "text": "Really great article here.\n\nAnd perhaps it's because I'm rooting for the Dream to extend this series, but damn I hadn't thought about this scenario..."}, "embed": {"media": {"images": [{"thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mot3564vimfncjhbsaeyiila/bafkreibdvnm7quo6tqhqyygptuogabpaqdyc5uynzdyewvjynmzzfo44sm", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mot3564vimfncjhbsaeyiila/bafkreibdvnm7quo6tqhqyygptuogabpaqdyc5uynzdyewvjynmzzfo44sm", "alt": "The Dream and Valkyries will tip-off at 12:30 p.m., and the Hawks are hosting the Cavaliers at 8 p.m., moving their starting time back to accommodate. Game 4 started at 1 p.m. with the Hawks playing at 8:30 p.m.\n\nFor both games, that\u2019s a 7.5 hour gap from the start of one to the start of the other.\n\nIf the Valkyries win the game, they win the series, but will they be able to celebrate on the court? Will Cathy Engelbert be there to present the trophy to the team and award the MVP? Will USA Network be able to have its postgame live in the arena?", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1609, "width": 1080}}], "$type": "app.bsky.embed.images#view"}, "record": {"record": {"uri": 